			<ul>
<li>On-site training and internships in leading infrastructure projects</li>
<li>Excellent placement support in construction, consulting, and public sector.</li>
<li>Focus on civil entrepreneurship and start-up development</li>
<li>Guidance for GATE and other competitive exams.</li>
<li>Advanced labs for material testing, environmental engineering, geotechnics, and transportation.</li>
</ul>

		</div>
	</div>
